		{
			dependencies: ["174353B4F6C61A79", "73D14393C00DE14D"]
			description: ["Circuit 4 blows air over uranium 238 for radon, with no plutonium needed. A Nether Star soaked in radon becomes a &6Quantum Star&r, and an Ender Eye becomes the Quantum Eye that EV sensors and emitters have waited for."]
